WEBVTT

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:11.890
别动。
Don't move.

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:17.130
告诉我……
Tell me...

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:18.890
你到底是从哪里来的？
Where did you come from?

00:00:20.301 --> 00:00:22.290
你：（不挣开）我是楼上宴会的摄影师。你的眼睛怎么回事？
You: (Don't pull away.) I'm the photographer for the party upstairs. What's wrong with your eyes?

00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:25.470
摄影师。你是来拍我订婚的。
A photographer. You came to shoot my engagement.

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:27.890
眼睛？那是你害的。
The eyes? That's your doing.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.210
留下。
Stay.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:34.130
:Luca：Harland把订婚仪式提前了。十分钟后。
:Luca: Harland moved the engagement up. Ten minutes.

00:00:37.905 --> 00:00:40.205
你：我害的？什么意思？
You: My doing? What do you mean?

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:45.490
是你的气息。我的双眼只听从它。
It's your scent. My eyes answer to it.

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:50.210
原来你在这里。
There you are.

00:00:51.180 --> 00:00:55.150
Mate。这就是你对我的意义。
Mate. That's what you are to me.

00:00:55.509 --> 00:00:57.809
你：和他一起上车
You: Get into the car with him

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:02.910
上车。
Get in.

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:10.050
你的气息现在在我身上。每一匹狼都会知道。
Your scent is on me now. Every wolf will know.

00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:13.060
在我的庄园里，没人能碰你。
At my estate, no one can touch you.

00:01:13.113 --> 00:01:15.310
你：那“mate”到底是什么意思？全都告诉我。
You: So what does 'mate' actually mean? Tell me everything.

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:20.490
一匹狼。一个Mate。一生只有一个。
One wolf. One Mate. Only one, for life.

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:24.870
高于任何契约，任何名分。
Higher than any contract. Any name.

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:30.490
让他们去叫吧。你是我选中的人。
Let them call. You're the one I chose.

00:01:30.717 --> 00:01:33.017
你：一直给你打电话的是谁？是她吗？
You: Who keeps calling you? Is it her?

00:01:36.020 --> 00:01:37.930
Selene。她从来都不是我的。
Selene. She was never mine.

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:41.210
今晚，我已经放弃了它。
Tonight I walked away from it.

00:01:42.020 --> 00:01:46.090
那是我的气息。在这里，到处都是。
It's my scent. Here, it's everywhere.

00:01:48.321 --> 00:01:50.621
你：跟着他走进起居室
You: Follow him into the living room

00:01:52.140 --> 00:01:55.550
过来。会平静下来的。
Come. It'll settle.

00:01:57.180 --> 00:01:59.990
闻到你气味的那一刻，我就丢下了它。
I walked out on it the moment I caught your scent.

00:02:01.380 --> 00:02:02.910
Selene 从来不是我的。
Selene was never mine.

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:12.650
我没有在等任何人。
I'm not expecting anyone.

00:02:05.925 --> 00:02:08.225
你：那是谁？你在等人吗？
You: Who's that? Were you expecting someone?

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:15.610
待在我身后。
Stay behind me.

00:02:15.660 --> 00:02:21.830
人类，Magnus？满月之前，长老会就会带走她。
A human, Magnus? The Council will have her before the full moon.

00:02:23.529 --> 00:02:25.829
你：把手按在他的背上
You: Press your hand to his back

00:02:26.360 --> 00:02:28.030
别动。
Don't move.

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:34.530
我不会让他们带走你。
I won't let them take you.

00:02:38.640 --> 00:02:40.230
那你感受到的是什么？
Then what is it you feel?

00:02:41.133 --> 00:02:43.110
你：她说的满月是什么意思？看着我。
You: What did she mean by full moon? Look at me.

00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:45.330
看着我。我在这儿。
Look at me. I'm here.

00:02:45.380 --> 00:02:48.590
长老会定了期限。就是满月。
The Council sets a deadline. The full moon.

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:53.250
Alpha。Harland召集了长老。就在今晚。
Alpha. Harland has called the elders. Tonight.

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:56.430
那他们会当面听到我的回答。
Then they'll hear my answer in person.

00:02:58.737 --> 00:03:01.037
你：牵起他的手，跟他走
You: Take his hand and go with him

00:03:03.640 --> 00:03:07.010
那就站在我身边。
Then stand beside me.

00:03:08.180 --> 00:03:10.230
进去之前。
Before we go in.

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:16.270
我不想再把你藏起来了。
I'm done hiding you.

00:03:16.341 --> 00:03:18.641
你：我不害怕。我会留下，但不许再有秘密。
You: I'm not afraid. I'll stay, but no more secrets.

00:03:20.290 --> 00:03:23.470
不会再有秘密了。我保证。
No more secrets. I promise.

00:03:25.240 --> 00:03:29.630
我是狼。Mate的意思就是，没有你我活不下去。
I'm a wolf. Mate means I can't live without you.

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:31.470
还在害怕吗？
Still afraid?

00:03:33.945 --> 00:03:36.245
你：接吧。但我要和你一起去。
You: Answer it. But I'm coming with you.

00:03:37.620 --> 00:03:41.490
那就来吧。留在我身边。
Then come. Stay beside me.

00:03:41.540 --> 00:03:45.250
:Harland：把她交出来，Magnus。律法比你古老。
:Harland: Hand her over, Magnus. The law is older than you.

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:51.130
律法今晚终结。她是我的Mate。
The law ends tonight. She is my Mate.
